简单来说 / In short:

✅ 欢迎 / Welcome:
   学习、研究、非商业转载与二次创作 —— 注明出处（署名「王润圆 Runyuan Wang」
   + 原仓库链接）就好啦
   Learning, research, and non-commercial sharing or remixing — just give
   credit ("Runyuan Wang" + a link to this repo).

🚫 请勿 / Please don't:
   商业使用、抹去出处、原样搬运后当成自己的作品。
   Any commercial use, removing the credit, or reposting the work as your own.

公益开源项目，希望能帮助更多的人 💛
A public-welfare open-source project, hoping to help more people 💛
